{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4c2kVWTnBZ5zZA8nn2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within weathered iron. Rust flakes drift like copper snow.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber.*\n\n*I swing inward — slowly, heavily — hinges screaming their century-long protest. Cold air rushes past from the darkness beyond, carrying the scent of stone and forgotten time.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What waits beyond is yours to face.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":102,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}